# 換行策略：repo 內文字檔一律 LF；Windows 腳本保留 CRLF 以免 cmd 解析錯誤
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔：不做換行轉換、不產生 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
